    "detailed_description": "<u>Pure Simple Physics Fun</u><br><br>Green Squares is A colourful physics based time trial, where there are green squares, that need to be not green! <br><br>Main Features: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 Levels<br></li><li>Multiple Difficulties per level<br></li><li>Endless variants of each level, relax in your favourite levels playing them on an infinite loop, or practice for your next PB! <br></li><li>Idle mode in main menu, just sit back and relax<br></li><li>13 Upbeat Songs, and yes there's a volume slider so you can listen to your own favourite playlist!</li></ul>",
